<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Club Voyages Antilles — Séjours & Circuits 2025</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Club Voyages Antilles : séjours organisés, circuits découverte, voyages en groupe. Martinique, Guadeloupe, Saint-Barth, Saint-Martin.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://club-voyages.com/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Club Voyages Antilles — Séjours & Circuits 2025">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Club Voyages Antilles : séjours organisés, circuits découverte, voyages en groupe. Martinique, Guadeloupe, Saint-Barth, Saint-Martin.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://club-voyages.com/">

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "@id": "https://club-voyages.com/#website",
    "url": "https://club-voyages.com/",
    "name": "Club Voyages Antilles",
    "description": "Club Voyages Antilles : séjours organisés, circuits découverte, voyages en groupe. Martinique, Guadeloupe, Saint-Barth, Saint-Martin.",
    "inLanguage": "fr-FR"
  }
  </script>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Baskerville:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg:      #f0f6fb;
      --bg2:     #dceef8;
      --text:    #0d2035;
      --accent:  #6b1a4a;
      --light:   #6b1a4a22;
      --muted:   #0d203599;
      --border:  #0d203522;
      --f1: 'Libre Baskerville', Georgia, serif;
      --f2: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: var(--f2); background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); overflow-x: hidden; }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 4rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .logo {
      font-family: var(--f1); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
      padding: 8rem 4rem 5rem;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg2) 50%, var(--bg) 100%);
    }
    .hero-deco {
      position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0;
      width: 50%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 30%, #6b1a4a11 100%);
    }
    .hero-deco::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; bottom: 10%; right: 8%;
      width: 300px; height: 300px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid #6b1a4a22;
      animation: pulse-ring 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .hero-deco::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; bottom: 15%; right: 13%;
      width: 180px; height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #6b1a4a0a;
      border: 1px solid #6b1a4a33;
      animation: pulse-ring 4s ease-in-out infinite 1s;
    }
    @keyframes pulse-ring {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 0.6; }
    }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 720px; }
    .hero-label {
      font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
      animation: fade-up 0.8s 0.1s both;
    }
    .hero-label::before { content: ''; display: block; width: 2rem; height: 1px; background: var(--accent); }
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--f1); font-weight: 300;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
      line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--text); animation: fade-up 0.8s 0.2s both;
    }
    h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
    h1 .ghost { -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #6b1a4a66; color: transparent; }
    .hero-tagline {
      font-family: var(--f1); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 300;
      font-style: italic; line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--muted); max-width: 520px;
      margin-top: 2rem; animation: fade-up 0.8s 0.3s both;
    }
    .stats {
      display: flex; gap: 3rem; margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      animation: fade-up 0.8s 0.4s both;
    }
    .stat-n { font-family: var(--f1); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1; }
    .stat-l { font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .cta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 2.5rem; animation: fade-up 0.8s 0.5s both; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block; padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      background: var(--accent); color: white;
      font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-ghost {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    @keyframes fade-up {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* FEATURES */
    .features { padding: 6rem 4rem; background: var(--bg2); }
    .section-header { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent);
      display: block; margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--f1); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text);
    }
    .section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
    .cards-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--bg); padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--border); transition: border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
    .card-icon { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .card h3 {
      font-family: var(--f1); font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; color: var(--text);
    }
    .card p { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); }

    /* BLOG BAND */
    .blog-band {
      padding: 3.5rem 4rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .blog-band h3 {
      font-family: var(--f1); font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; color: white;
    }
    .blog-band p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-top: 0.3rem; }
    .btn-white {
      display: inline-block; padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      background: white; color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .btn-white:hover { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(-1px); }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 4rem;
      background: var(--text);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .footer-logo { font-family: var(--f1); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--bg); }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
    .footer-links a {
      font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--bg); }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 0.65rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero { padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
      .features { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .cards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .blog-band { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
      .footer-links { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
      .stats { gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .cards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="logo">Club Voyages</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/contact/">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="hero-deco"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-label">club-voyages.com</span>
      <h1>
        Club<br>
        <em>Voyages</em><br>
        <span class="ghost">Antilles</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Séjours organisés, circuits découverte et voyages en groupe aux Antilles françaises — tout compris ou à la carte.</p>
      <div class="stats">
        <div><div class="stat-n">12</div><div class="stat-l">Circuits disponibles</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-n">7j</div><div class="stat-l">Séjour moyen</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-n">350€</div><div class="stat-l">Prix/pers. mini</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="#services" class="btn">Découvrir</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn-ghost">Lire le blog →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
    <section class="features" id="destinations">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Nos destinations</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Choisir son<br><em>île de rêve</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">🌋</div><h3>Martinique</h3><p>Montagne Pelée, rhum agricole AOC, plages de sable blanc et gastronomie créole reconnue mondialement.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">🏝️</div><h3>Guadeloupe</h3><p>Archipel de 5 îles, Réserve Cousteau, Grande-Terre et Basse-Terre — deux visages pour une seule île papillon.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">⛵</div><h3>Saint-Barth</h3><p>25 km² de luxe et de discrétion — plages confidentielles, gastronomie de prestige, marina internationale.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">🛍️</div><h3>Saint-Martin</h3><p>Île partagée franco-néerlandaise — shopping duty-free, plages animées, cuisine fusion et vie nocturne.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

  <div class="blog-band">
    <div>
      <h3>Articles & guides sur club-voyages.com</h3>
      <p>Conseils d'experts, actualités et guides pratiques mis à jour régulièrement.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/blog/" class="btn-white">Accéder au blog →</a>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <span class="footer-logo">club-voyages.com</span>
    <ul class="footer-links">
      <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/contact/">Contact</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/mentions-legales/">Mentions légales</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sitemap.xml">Sitemap</a></li>
    </ul>
    <span class="footer-copy">© 2025 club-voyages.com</span>
  </footer>

<script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v31edd6df95cf4e85bb4c19e7a9bdbcba1788362987495" integrity="sha512-iIg7k2xntmwu6/uSb5tpc/hySgZc4eoL31yB29W6tJFo2akwjPWcEqnCEdJvGexCL0KEQwVYv5BlowfhVz26hg==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"315486789de24132a6d692e22a6e8a7c","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body>
</html>